# 仓库级换行与二进制标记：文本统一 LF，二进制文件禁止被当作文本 diff/合并
* text=auto eol=lf

# 图片
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.svg text

# 音频
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary

# 字体
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 3D 资源
*.glb binary
*.gltf text
*.fbx binary
*.obj text
*.blend binary

# 字体/压缩包
*.zip binary
